    "component_id": "C056.signal_basis",
    "value": "Prospectively monitor the trial's operational effects; compromised safe use is an explicit stop-or-revise condition.",
    "scope": "Applies during the selected trial. Observed workload or cleaning problems do not automatically establish compromised safe use.",
